   │                                                                   │
   │     DECISION RULE:                                                │
   │                                                                   │
   │        ASK  ⟺  VOI(a_q | M_t) > C_q                               │
   │                                                                   │
   └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   INTUITION:

     The AI asks because information has DECISION VALUE.
     The query is an INVESTMENT whose payoff is the reduction in
     future worst-case decision loss.

     ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
     │  NOT circular:                                                │
     │                                                              │
     │    VOI is an EXPECTED VALUE.                                 │
     │    Decision rule COMPARES that value to cost.                │
     │                                                              │
